                        "title": "How Electrical Diagnostic Tools Prevent Breakdowns",
                        "url": "/blog/posts/how-electrical-diagnostic-tools-prevent-breakdowns",
                        "excerpt": "With today’s heavy-duty vehicles relying on dozens of sensors, electronic control modules, wiring harnesses, and onboard computers, even a small electrical issue can quickly turn into unexpected downtime. That’s why professional electrical diagnostic tools have become essential for keeping trucks on the road."
                      },
                      {
                        "slug": "common-problems-with-air-brake-parts-for-semi-trucks",
                        "topic": "Parts",
